sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Host: world and body
  participant Q as Qwen's 32 layers
  participant F as The fly's 3 layers
  H->>Q: report text: position, drops, perch, time fed
  loop taste, proboscis, antennae, wings
    H->>F: SAY token
    F-->>Q: the fly's word, e.g. " sweet"
  end
  H->>Q: the question, ending at "):"
  Q->>F: final state at "):" sets 7 drive registers
  loop 200 steps of 0.1 ms
    F->>F: spike tokens through the connectome, then TICK
  end
  F-->>H: motor rates every 1 ms (MOVE rows)
  H->>H: the body moves, and the senses update the sense registers
